{"change":"The old point_in_polygon_tool(point, polygon) was removed. The real replacement points_within_polygon_tool requires points=[point] and polygon; its response is points_within/count/total instead of inside/point. Preserving the old contract requires dynamic singleton-array construction and a count-to-boolean conversion, while retaining the original input point.","evidence_urls":["https://github.com/mapbox/mcp-server/blob/aae9e2fa777aab88809950032841675a844691df/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/mapbox/mcp-server/commit/85eb71d9b2283a42c5d6de2e33c93f748feeff82"],"images":{"new":"sha256:0c296fc82aab23c6096392e821f6ef48b29de71a1b9c3752579813269bff81ca","old":"sha256:b018bc195e533ab409abd4860ede7ab64fc150db367e0094e9c4341171f94393"},"limitations":["Offline local geometry only; no Mapbox API, token, network, geocoding or routing is evaluated.","Native schemas and outputs are retained. No array wrapper or response adapter is supplied to ContractRelay.","The selected released tags bracket the documented removal; other upstream changes between releases are outside the selected workflow."],"new_commit":"aae9e2fa777aab88809950032841675a844691df","new_tag":"v0.12.3","old_commit":"7d2c0f323915ebd4aeb3ff6721cae51c81300941","old_tag":"v0.11.0","repository":"https://github.com/mapbox/mcp-server","runtime_audit":{"new":{"compiled_dist_sha256":"ff263cfae93f36d2f8239f0fed3c63eefdaa555ccfe9dfb863b81b81693e3a0c","lock_sha256":"cd759e9c714900c1407b799a138e37ba3a40b2e788e43430771c02a738edf74b","version":{"branch":"master","sha":"aae9e2fa777aab88809950032841675a844691df","tag":"v0.12.3","version":"0.12.3"}},"old":{"compiled_dist_sha256":"3c78674a26f9e670f1d088ead1c8d49aa8456a1aa0f006788ddf2cf825ef9fb5","lock_sha256":"c6b1c83ca1dfe9d5433f0d521fd901089cb1de6655a4eac1eacdbf4c8baedc97","version":{"branch":"master","sha":"7d2c0f323915ebd4aeb3ff6721cae51c81300941","tag":"v0.11.0","version":"0.11.0"}}},"setup":"Unmodified real historical server entry point. Read-only, network-disabled c